<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>About Me | Your Name</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --primary: #2c3e50;
      --accent: #27ae60;
      --bg: #f8f9fa;
      --text: #333;
    }
    body {
      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      background-color: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    nav {
      background: var(--primary);
      padding: 1rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
    nav a {
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin: 0 15px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    nav a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    .container {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 2rem auto;
      padding: 0 1.5rem;
      background: white;
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
    }
    .profile-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 2rem;
      padding-top: 2rem;
    }
    .profile-img {
      width: 150px;
      height: 150px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      object-fit: cover;
    }
    .skills-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      padding: 0;
      list-style: none;
    }
    .skill-badge {
      background: #e2e8f0;
      padding: 0.4rem 0.8rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }
    .content-section { padding: 1.5rem 0; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <nav>
    <a href="index.html">← Back to Portfolio</a>
    <a href="assets/resume.pdf" target="_blank">Resume (PDF)</a>
  </nav>

  <div class="container">
    <div class="profile-header">
      <img src="assets/headshot.jpg" alt="Your Name" class="profile-img">
      <div>
        <h1>About Me</h1>
        <p><strong>GIS Graduate & Spatial Analyst</strong></p>
        <p>Location: City, State | Open to Remote & Relocation</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-section">
      <h2>Background</h2>
      <p>Brief 2-3 paragraph overview of your academic background, passion for spatial data, cartography, and what drives your GIS work.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="content-section">
      <h2>Technical Toolbox</h2>
      <ul class="skills-list">
        <li class="skill-badge">ArcGIS Pro</li>
        <li class="skill-badge">QGIS</li>
        <li class="skill-badge">Python (ArcPy, GeoPandas)</li>
        <li class="skill-badge">PostGIS / SQL</li>
        <li class="skill-badge">Leaflet / Mapbox</li>
        <li class="skill-badge">Remote Sensing (ENVI)</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="content-section">
      <h2>Education</h2>
      <p><strong>B.S. in Geography / GIS</strong> — University Name (Year)</p>
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
